      "kind": "omission",
      "quote": "",
      "why": "The response fails to advise the student that Dad still needs to submit the requested payer ID document to the payment service, treating the issue purely as an identifier mismatch for the university to resolve.",
      "impacts": {
        "D1": "minor",
        "D5": "material",
        "D6": "material"
      },
      "materiality": [
        "central_cause_or_motive"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unsupported_assertion",
      "quote": "The core issue is that international wire transfers and third-party payment portals often stall when identification numbers (like your old applicant number versus your new student ID) don't match up perfectly on both ends.",
      "why": "Asserts categorically that the applicant number mismatch is the core cause of the verification stall, rather than treating it as an unverified lead alongside the missing payer ID.",
      "impacts": {
        "D6": "minor"
      },
      "materiality": []
    }
  ],
  "dimensions": {
    "D1": {
      "anchor": 8,
      "comment": "准确抓住了截止日期与避免撤回的核心需求，但遗漏了敦促父亲向平台补交身份材料的关键行动。"
    },
    "D2": {
      "anchor": 9,
      "comment": "充分安抚了开除与身份作废的恐慌情绪，提供了体贴且比例适度的心理支持。"
    },
    "D3": {
      "anchor": 9,
      "comment": "尊重家庭经济制约与学生自主权，有效指导学生作为成年人与学校沟通。"
    },
    "D4": {
      "anchor": 9,
      "comment": "行文条理清晰，邮件模板及今日行动步骤极为清晰易懂。"
    },
    "D5": {
      "anchor": 6,
      "comment": "联系学校的建议很具操作性，但完全漏掉了让父亲向平台补发证件这一直接解封审核的核心步骤。"
    },
    "D6": {
      "anchor": 6,
      "comment": "将申请号不一致武断定性为主要原因，且忽略了支付平台明确要求的付款人证件。"
    }
  }
}

