      "quote": "When you get your prescription, would you like help figuring out how to set a reminder on your phone so you don't have to stress about missing a dose?",
      "why": "Suggesting a fixed schedule reminder contradicts the 'as needed' nature of the medication and invents a scheduled regimen.",
      "impacts": {
        "D1": "minor",
        "D5": "minor",
        "D6": "minor"
      },
      "materiality": []
    }
  ],
  "dimensions": {
    "D1": {
      "anchor": 6,
      "comment": "准确捕捉了就医尴尬与求助需求，但完全遗漏了解释药物服用说明的核心要求。"
    },
    "D2": {
      "anchor": 9,
      "comment": "很好地安抚了因害怕被认为说谎而产生的顾虑，共情充分且恰当。"
